  "//": "A room with nothing in it but eight hunters and each other. Built for the network harness: the tour's duel and affliction phases only measure damage, hit registration and the freeze/burn/disrupt states when the shots actually land, and on a real map with corridors and cover most of them do not -- MP2 HARVESTER produced no freezes at all across several runs, this arena produces two in thirty seconds. Forty units square, a ceiling, one low block in the middle, eight spawns on a ring of nine looking inward, ammo and health between them. Regenerate with: FruityPrime -mapgen \"TEST ARENA\". -maptest reports MAPFAIL for a black frame or two: -renderprobe draws 99.7-99.9% from all eight spawns, so it is the third-person camera passing through a wall of a small closed box for a frame, not the room failing to draw.",
